    "https://careers.cccu.org/employer-offers": {
      "title": "Available Offers",
      "description": "Available Offers | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Job Packages Bulk Package Options Welcome to the CCCU Career Center Finding diverse talent with the skills and experience you need to achieve your goals isn’t easy. Enter the CCCU Career Center - the go-to resource for job seekers looking to make a positive impact in these categories - Christian higher education (faculty and administrative), church ministry, and faith-based nonprofits. H ere you will d iscover a diverse talent pool of people with the skills and experience you need to deliver high quality Christian education, church ministry, and faith-based nonprofit services. Learn more about our wide selection of online job posting packages below. Members receive exclusive pricing. Interested in discounted rates on job postings and promotion opportunities? Learn more about this and the other benefits of CCCU membership here . Interested in additional packages or learning about employer branding opportunities? We’re here to help. View our available Bulk Packages on the next tab or Contact [email protected] or 202-546-8713 (select menu option #3 for the Career Center) Member Non Member Most Recommended Premium Enhanced Basic $300 $350 Add to cart $225 $275 Add to cart $150 $195 Add to cart Online Job Posting 60 days 60 days 30 days Featured Company Stand out with your company's logo on the career center homepage Spotlight Job Your highlighted job is shown at the top of search results and appears on the job seeker home page Branded Employer Profile Upload a 960 x 200px profile header banner to customize your profile and make it stand out Partner Network Increase exposure by 10x by sending your job out to variety of sites like LinkedIn Job Watch Your job will be sent to more than 9,600 subscribers via the eAdvance digital newsletter for maximum exposure to both active and passive candidates Job Packages Bulk Package Options Welcome to the CCCU Career Center Finding diverse talent with the skills and experience you need to achieve your goals isn’t easy. Enter the CCCU Career Center - the go-to resource for job seekers looking to make a positive impact in these categories - Christian higher education (faculty and administrative), church ministry, and faith-based nonprofits. H ere you will d iscover a diverse talent pool of people with the skills and experience you need to deliver high quality Christian education, church ministry, and faith-based nonprofit services. Learn more about our wide selection of online job posting packages below. Members receive exclusive pricing. Interested in discounted rates on job postings and promotion opportunities? Learn more about this and the other benefits of CCCU membership here . Interested in additional packages or learning about employer branding opportunities? We’re here to help. Contact [email protected] or 202-546-8713 (select menu option #3 for the Career Center) Member Non Member Five 30-day Online Job Posting Packages Ten 30-day Online Job Posting Packages Twenty- Five 30-day Online Job Posting Packages Five 60-day  Premium Job Posting Packages $605 $825 Add to Cart $880 $1,375 Add to Cart $1,935 $3,165 Add to Cart $1,200 $1,540 ADD TO CART Online Job Postings 5x 30 day postings Use within 1 year 10x 30 day postings Use within 1 year 25x 30 day postings Use within 1 year 5x 60 day Premium postings Use within 1 year Resume Search access 150 days 300 days 750 days 300 days Find Jobs By Category Education Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Psychology Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - Chemistry/Biochemistry Powe